<title>CANADA: GOLF-THIRD ROUND LEADERS AT LPGA DU MAURIER CLASSIC.</title>
<headline>GOLF-THIRD ROUND LEADERS AT LPGA DU MAURIER CLASSIC.</headline>
<dateline>OAKVILLE, Ontario 1997-08-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after</p>
<p>the third round of the LPGA du Maurier Classic golf tournament</p>
<p>on Saturday (players U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>209 Kelly Robbins 71-65-73</p>
<p>210 Brandie Burton 69-75-66, Juli Inkster 70-69-71</p>
<p>211 Rosie Jones 69-71-71, Liselotte Neumann (Sweden) 71-67-73</p>
<p>212 Cindy Figg-Currier 69-74-69, Tina Barrett 71-71-70, Betsy</p>
<p>King 71-69-72</p>
<p>213 Karrie Webb (Australia) 71-72-70, Colleen Walker 68-72-73</p>
<p>214 Helen Alfredsson (Sweden) 75-70-69, Emilee Klein</p>
<p>73-70-71, Chris Johnson 70-72-72</p>
<p>215 Danielle Ammaccapane 71-75-69, Deb Richard 72-73-70, Kim</p>
<p>Saiki 75-69-71, Meg Mallon 74-70-71, Dale Reid 73-71-71, Wendy</p>
<p>Ward 72-71-72</p>
</text>
